|---|---:|
| Output spindle P000095 / P000207 | +0.050 |
| Stage 4 A000861 / P003047 | -0.099 |
| Stage 3 A000860 / P003045 | -0.142 |
| Stage 5 A000606 / P001849 | -0.177 |
| Bearing K000004 | -0.197 |
